{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "8dfb58816936deb15d03f1d2106b097d71a0e941e8decde00c41709881ea3f1e", "ja": "先輩と後輩", "zh": "前辈与后辈", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9afbeb522dde16ff3b00b010e9dc4eda9505b33473f397c8109384fc0f112fd4", "ja": "大人気配信番組から出演依頼を受けたものの\r\n『先輩と後輩』というテーマに懸念が残る\r\nプロデューサー。春香と未来に話をすると\r\nふたりも同じ事を気にしていたが、それでも\r\n「メリットがある」と、挑戦する事に。", "zh": "虽然收到了高人气网络节目的出演邀请，\n但对于“前辈与后辈”这一主题，制作人仍心存顾虑。\n把这件事告诉春香和未来后，两人也同样在意这一点，\n但即便如此，她们还是认为“很有意义”，决定接受挑战。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3748b1363442f9c3722b8d1406f01a95a03f465b0cac12c1a944ecc7c51f4cb4", "ja": "（ミーティングを設け、春香と未来に\n仕事内容の説明をした。ふたりの反応は……）", "zh": "（安排了会议，向春香和未来说明了工作内容。两人的反应是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "77954577796194d883c7e3a7c41cd800c1b00f4dcadd0e6a8bea05123deb3c96", "ja": "あっ！　この配信、見たことあります！\n有名なパティシエの人が出た回があって……。", "zh": "啊！我看过这个节目！\n有一期请来了很有名的糕点师……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "22ae5aeebe32bb2b179f84c50d7333a0541e15cb10eb91ed01153760fdd9073d", "ja": "私も、友達といっしょに見ました！\nオススメにもよく出るんですよね～。", "zh": "我也和朋友一起看了！也经常出现在推荐里呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "dec53b73b2cc885cb4583e71b79ee04f986d7b51ac575f800f205a1775c45de9", "ja": "そっかぁ……ここから私たちにオファーが……。\nでも、『先輩と後輩』……。", "zh": "原来如此……所以是从这里向我们发出了邀约……  \n不过，“前辈和后辈”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "63a5785a137f07eceee79b2c44f2c4622079cee47bf7e9893317bc61dd3c65b3", "ja": "気になるところは同じだな。先方は、その枠組みで\n春香と未来を呼びたいと言っているけど……。", "zh": "在意的地方是一样的啊。对方说想以那种关系，让春香和未来参加……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "f24cff516beafb4b18cfbdf7c239c672c374a70701dedbad852dba507ee9d757", "ja": "私と未来ちゃんは、先輩と後輩……\nその、間違いではないんですけど。", "zh": "我和未来是前辈和后辈……\n那个，倒也没错就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c3971cb603c07bb145f707ffe484e94a337b5fbe2ddc8cf0d7512ef3c7a57f35", "ja": "そうだな。\n未来はどうだ？", "zh": "是啊。未来，你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "1180498a7b450d6fbdcca0d10185bb8d600d6262aea9c63222f4cfbc04bd95fc", "ja": "えっと！　春香さんとお仕事できるのは、\nとってもうれしいです！　けど……。", "zh": "那个！能和春香前辈一起工作，我真的特别开心！可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "8d99947d1dec8e3994f767010b48337a85d2bd7a32f9c56f7fc2d4999d9f092e", "ja": "私だから、選んでもらえたんじゃなくて。\n春香さんの後輩だからなのかなー？って……。", "zh": "不是因为我自己才被选上的吧。\n是因为我是春香前辈的后辈，才被选中的吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "5866fd23f6ff1086c9d3e923d2c7e00ece8032e1328cbe4cbb81e6adb5a8535b", "ja": "未来ちゃん……。", "zh": "未来……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "34de44a911921d08b7c3a92a592fc76d52955492f020520411f692987a189140", "ja": "それって、先輩に頼ってるみたいで、\nよくないかもですよね……？", "zh": "那样感觉像是在依赖前辈，\n可能不太好吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d8aeca5fb30433d8de91aadc2b18f26926532ccffc14897ee0330b0e2442087b", "ja": "悩むのは当然だ。社長もそこを懸念していたし、\n最終的な判断もふたりの意思を尊重するつもりだ。", "zh": "会犹豫也是理所当然的。社长也担心这一点，\n最终的决定也会尊重你们两人的意愿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1c3594e7c118f824eef1a247d27856a84d4889dccab9c2157231d8bb59fc9fc0", "ja": "ただ当然、悪い部分ばかりじゃない。\nメリットの話もしておこう。", "zh": "不过，当然也不全是坏处。\n有利之处也先说说吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "efc3b595b1547c8a700819275baf3c4d9f04a8ee5fd01f085bab44da6fae4c29", "ja": "メリット……。\nやっぱり、知名度ですか？", "zh": "优势……。\n果然是知名度吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1014_p", "source_sha256": "9b3b243152583d6d7b74966ea36237dd98b1733e573c014424cca30d150e73c6", "ja": "ああ。ふたりとも既に知っていたように、大勢の人が\n見ている人気番組だ。大きなチャンスに違いはない。", "zh": "是的。正如你们两个人之前已经知道的那样，这是有很多人收看的热门节目。毫无疑问，是个很大的机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "86bf131bebe574fc7ae1e3585d7866825188e40b89584f7ca1b2be1945f46bb4", "ja": "今の時代、ネットの影響力は、時として\nテレビを超える。うまく活かすことが出来れば……。", "zh": "在如今这个时代，网络的影响力有时会超过电视。如果能好好利用的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "5d59b0f0f99394558da33c28a4aed797bc05af55de81f47ea0c5f07411035cee", "ja": "それって……\nお仕事が増えるってことですか？", "zh": "这就是说……工作会增加吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1017_p", "source_sha256": "9f9cef4f94d4e6e28e0b9639452a6f242ba0749ce14490c553ccbbebf08ef62d", "ja": "反響がよければ、\nその可能性は高くなるはずだ。", "zh": "如果反响不错，可能性应该会更高。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "a52a010d8b1ef4c7299df66127b446ffd43f45cf0c21dbc23513c91290af3a4d", "ja": "チャンスか……\n未来ちゃんは、どう思う？", "zh": "机会吗……\n未来，你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "ba3acde60c50af6fc493a78aa87b410cfbdb93181ead440befb7359dd8820982", "ja": "私は、えっと……。", "zh": "我……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "fbb5e7081f359a66cc18ce496b50fe27c5b73ae9a9c2132e9868bbbdfc4692dc", "ja": "は……春香さんがイヤじゃなければ、\n挑戦してみたいです！", "zh": "如……如果春香前辈不介意的话，我想挑战一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "1357a0ba06887cbf46b5aa18a0e7d4c50d167432eac02357cc6762fdc9aff966", "ja": "だって、すっごいチャンスだから！\n何もしないで見逃すなんて、できないです！", "zh": "因为这可是千载难逢的机会啊！\n我可不能什么都不做，就这样错过！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1023_001har", "source_sha256": "82f7e0b0c48665ec6ee6d568532f7de616515a6b6f69c06ca3e3f2713d030dc4", "ja": "わかった。……{$P$}さん。\n私も、未来ちゃんに賛成です！", "zh": "我知道了。……{$P$}先生。\n我也赞成未来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "fcd73dfc87297f908bb69810439fc7edba108e6290e7a1edf5cfcb0b16a63466", "ja": "よし。そういうことなら、全力で行くぞ。\n一気に知名度を上げられるよう、頑張ろう！", "zh": "好。既然这样，那就全力以赴吧。\n争取一口气打响知名度，加油干吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1025_001har", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "686439129d4746ae406f6fc8aaa2644fe798da41d0c131c0a94211104a93fb52", "ja": "が、がんばります！", "zh": "我、我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1027_p", "source_sha256": "14abe42589c4496ab13516b12ae560143c1c71b55d1aae65e1663102b5737fdd", "ja": "それじゃ、改めて作戦会議だ。他の業界の人達に\n埋もれないよう、ふたりの特徴を押し出していこう。", "zh": "那么，我们重新开个作战会议吧。为了不被其他行业的人埋没，就突出你们两人的特点吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1028_014mir", "source_sha256": "ea08cf01dca1c707c70c4754fa46fd62c810fe2f66a0c3cbb9a06684f9e7f43d", "ja": "はい！　いろんな『先輩と後輩』が来るはずです\nもんね……うーん、私たちの特徴は……。", "zh": "是！应该会有各种各样的“前辈和后辈”到场吧……嗯，我们的特点是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1029_014mir", "source_sha256": "3c43219413db3f4858aa533615376be16fba37f48bb0cb21ad3775015ba2bf25", "ja": "やっぱり、仲良しだと思います！\n春香さんはお姉ちゃんっぽさがあるから！", "zh": "我觉得还是关系很好这点吧！\n因为春香小姐很有大姐姐的感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1030_001har", "source_sha256": "2d2a835b7f357c8ae8d556a3afdd9cdbee555ca9926cdbd55473fbb1ecd6f7f0", "ja": "お姉ちゃんっぽさか……えへへ。\n改めて言われると、なんだか照れちゃうね……♪", "zh": "像姐姐一样的感觉吗……嘿嘿。\n被你这么一说，突然感觉有点害羞呢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1031_p", "source_sha256": "1fea6ac2640935844cbb9443c8f61cc0a03d91bd53ec5eb708e228dc44584255", "ja": "仲良し姉妹みたいな路線か……。\n悪くはないけど、それだけだと弱いかもな。", "zh": "走要好姐妹那种路线吗……\n倒也不坏，但光是这样可能还不够有力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1032_014mir", "source_sha256": "78594240a63d8f0e66495d582b95e9612373438e6d75bf848f687d720265e104", "ja": "それじゃあ……\n仲間だけどライバル、とか！", "zh": "那么……\n既是伙伴，又是对手之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1033_001har", "source_sha256": "e5cd743ff2f1dbca5a56138e652f291ec07862b37e94b1a111c38468e721ee75", "ja": "そうだね。劇場の仲間であり、\nアイドルとしてはライバルでもあり……。", "zh": "是啊。既是剧场的伙伴，\n作为偶像又是竞争对手……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1034_p", "source_sha256": "d3f1ab06718ca1122306f458da80262c43a34ca420048078be54bfb7bf9ea159", "ja": "（ふたりとも前向きに取り組んでくれている。\n不安要素はあるものの、ひとまずはスタートだな）", "zh": "（她们两个都在积极地配合。虽然还有令人不安的因素，但总之算是迈出第一步了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_01_1035_p", "source_sha256": "dd0d6128137efa2f769476a0fa3542ebf9b152813ee6c4e81a6486b7667d90f5", "ja": "（そして、挑むのならば全力だ。プロデューサー\nとして出来る限りのことをするぞ！）", "zh": "（既然要挑战，那就必须全力以赴。作为制作人，我要尽我所能！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
